<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Dragon Soul, Firelands, Twilight Protocol Dungeons, and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c7">Best in Slot Gear for Enhancement Shaman DPS in Phase 4</span></h2>
<b>
<span class="c4">Only break the Tier 12 set bonuses, if you have them, once you can go up in Item Level by doing so.</span></b> As the new tier bonuses from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> are not particularly strong compared to the old ones, replacing Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> tier pieces with LFR Dragon Soul ones can be skipped unless you have some normal Firelands pieces mixed in, in which case you should <a href="https://wowsims.github.io/cata/shaman/enhancement/" target="_blank">sim first</a> to make sure you are upgrading.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Note that <a class="icontiny" data-entity="race" data-game="wow" data-type="race" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/race=2/orc">
<img alt="Orc" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_orc_male.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Orc</span></a>s should reforge their belt into Mastery instead of Expertise to account for the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=20574/axe-specialization">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Axe Specialization</span></a> racial bonus when using the suggested gear set.</b>
<br/>
