<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-enhancement-shaman-dps">Head for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h4>The best head option available is the heroic tier head, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78686/spiritwalkers-helmet">
<img alt="Spiritwalker's Helmet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_raidshaman_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spiritwalker's Helmet</span></a>, with the Valor <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77150/zeherahs-dragonskull-crown">
<img alt="Zeherah's Dragonskull Crown" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_mail_raidhunter_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zeherah's Dragonskull Crown</span></a> or old tier head <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71549/erupting-volcanic-helmet">
<img alt="Erupting Volcanic Helmet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_raidshaman_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Erupting Volcanic Helmet</span></a> or any of the normal versions of the heroic items listed are also great options.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62369/arcanum-of-the-ramkahen">
